    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SIRE </strong>is a narrative card game about the death of a parent, and dealing with the complicated emotions that unleashes. Players combine cards to explore a darkly comedic, surreal world of loss and learning, in a mixture of classic point-n-click adventures and modern digital card games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779020/extras/186a1765eafc63df126272f29f81c127.poster.avif?t=1747501069\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779020/extras/186a1765eafc63df126272f29f81c127.webm?t=1747501069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779020/extras/186a1765eafc63df126272f29f81c127.mp4?t=1747501069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experimental yet highly playable art game that mixes a point 'n click adventures card game with FMV video and audio recordings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about overcoming personal loss and generational trauma, interwoven with my own exploration of losing my father, as the player travels to a distant land to visit their late father's funeral.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to an imperfect, forgotten artist and an ode to complex parental relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime of around 1.5 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Museum of Memories that showcases all surviving works of the artist Arthur van Laarhoven.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779020/extras/000805a1998d0ae4487a0d2648b2076a.poster.avif?t=1747501069\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779020/extras/000805a1998d0ae4487a0d2648b2076a.webm?t=1747501069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779020/extras/000805a1998d0ae4487a0d2648b2076a.mp4?t=1747501069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
