uted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779020/extras/000805a1998d0ae4487a0d2648b2076a.poster.avif?t=1747501069\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779020/extras/000805a1998d0ae4487a0d2648b2076a.webm?t=1747501069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779020/extras/000805a1998d0ae4487a0d2648b2076a.mp4?t=1747501069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
